# Supabase Configuration

```json
{
  "api": {
    "enabled": true,
    "schemas": ["public", "storage", "graphql_public"],
    "non_default_schemas": ["public"],
    "max_rows": 1000
  },
  "db": {
    "tables": [
      "users",
      "analyses"
    ]
  },
  "auth": {
    "enabled": true,
    "email": {
      "enabled": true,
      "confirm_email": false
    }
  },
  "storage": {
    "file_size_limit": 52428800,
    "allowed_mime_types": [
      "video/mp4",
      "video/quicktime",
      "image/*"
    ]
  }
}
```

## Environment Variables

Store these in your `.env` file:
```
SUPABASE_URL=https://jwixmhrsagenbhrecjpr.supabase.co
SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your_anon_key_here
```

## Database Connection

The database client automatically connects when the app starts using credentials from `.env`.

## Tables

### users
- For user authentication and profiles
- Auto-generated UUID primary key
- Email uniqueness constraint
- Auto timestamps

### analyses
- For storing cricket analysis results
- Links to users via foreign key
- JSONB fields for flexible data storage
- Indexed for fast queries
